### REST Client extension (humao.rest-client). Click "Send Request" above any request.
### Tokens: in a terminal in /backend run `python ../scripts/mint_token.py cco` and paste each below (re-mint cco right before approving: step-up allows 5 minutes).
@base = http://localhost:8000
@cco = PASTE_CCO_TOKEN
@marketing = PASTE_MARKETING_TOKEN
@admin = PASTE_FIRM_ADMIN_TOKEN
@reviewer = PASTE_REVIEWER_TOKEN
@campaign = PASTE_CAMPAIGN_ID
@firm = PASTE_FIRM_ID_FROM_SEED_OUTPUT

### Health
GET {{base}}/readyz

### Free audit (website contract). Try domains containing: held, nog5, slow, boom, lowtls
POST {{base}}/api/audit
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: {{$guid}}

{ "website": "yourfirm.com", "email": "you@yourfirm.com", "area": "Austin, Texas", "consent": true }

### Poll an audit (paste the id from above)
GET {{base}}/api/audit/PASTE_AUDIT_ID

### Who am I
GET {{base}}/v1/me
Authorization: Bearer {{cco}}

### Create a campaign (marketing)
POST {{base}}/v1/campaigns
Authorization: Bearer {{marketing}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "firm_id": "{{firm}}", "offer_id": "retirement_readiness", "platform": "google", "monthly_budget_cents": 300000, "budget_ceiling_cents": 500000 }

### Generate + fact-guard + pre-check + render, hand to the CCO
POST {{base}}/v1/campaigns/{{campaign}}/submit
Authorization: Bearer {{marketing}}
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### Read the campaign (shows content_hash, pre-check flags, the exact page)
GET {{base}}/v1/campaigns/{{campaign}}
Authorization: Bearer {{cco}}

### CCO approves (needs a FRESH cco token; content_hash from the call above)
POST {{base}}/v1/campaigns/{{campaign}}/decision
Authorization: Bearer {{cco}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "version": 1, "content_hash": "PASTE_CONTENT_HASH", "decision": "approve", "comment": "Reviewed" }

### Pause (firm admin pauses; marketing only requests)
POST {{base}}/v1/campaigns/{{campaign}}/pause
Authorization: Bearer {{admin}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "reason": "manual test" }

### Review queue (reviewer sees held audit reports)
GET {{base}}/v1/review-queue
Authorization: Bearer {{reviewer}}

### Activity log (CCO / admin / read-only)
GET {{base}}/v1/activity
Authorization: Bearer {{cco}}
